- Raw paired-end reads were assessed using FastQC.
- FastQC generated paired RawData reports for the six samples.
- The FastQC output collection was flattened into 12 individual datasets.
- MultiQC was used to aggregate the 12 FastQC outputs into a single quality-control report.


